msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Control of Downtown Ryukyu is divided between the Ryudo Family and the "
"Tamashiro Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"The Ryudo Family is small, but they get along with everyone. Can't say the "
"same for the Tamashiro Family, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"They take what they want by force, and they'll crush anyone who stands "
"against them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Supposedly, they're connected to some big group out in the mainland, so they"
" think they can do whatever they want."
msgstr ""

